  "q2": 0.5,
  "cos_theta*": 0,
  "phi": 90
}

But the key "cos_theta*" includes asterisk; need to be valid JSON key; it can include * but need to be quoted. In JSON, property names can include any Unicode characters, but when sending as arguments to the tool, need to be valid JSON keys; using quoted strings is fine.

So each point can be:
